<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>CPU on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/categories/cpu/</link><description>Recent content in CPU on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 02 Sep 2025 08:24:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/categories/cpu/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>獨立伺服器 CPU 頻率最大化配置指南</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2025/20250902-linux-cpu-performance/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Sep 2025 08:24:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2025/20250902-linux-cpu-performance/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.ibytebox.com/archives/02cf4c4a-0af7-43f1-bb65-ccdb54a52306" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;獨立伺服器 CPU 頻率最大化配置指南&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="看看-cpu-現在用哪種模式"&gt;看看 CPU 現在用哪種模式&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;前提條件
系統：Linux（Debian、Ubuntu、Proxmox 等都行）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;權限：root&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CPU：支援動態調頻（Intel Xeon、AMD EPYC / Ryzen 等）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="governor"&gt;governor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;cat /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu0/cpufreq/scaling_governor&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;powersave：省電小綿羊（頻率鎖低，省電但沒力）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ondemand：按需加速（要用時才升頻，可能反應慢半拍）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;performance：全程高能（我們要的就是它！💪）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="確認核心到底用哪種驅動intel--amd"&gt;確認核心到底用哪種驅動（Intel / AMD）&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;cat /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu0/cpufreq/scaling_driver&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="暫時拉滿效能"&gt;暫時拉滿效能&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-8809a2d8ce75afaaf86b81241d89bd5d-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; cpu in /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;0-9&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;*&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;do&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; performance &amp;gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$cpu&lt;/span&gt;/cpufreq/scaling_governor
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"for cpu in /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu[0-9]*; do\n echo performance \u003e $cpu/cpufreq/scaling_governor\ndone\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="重啟後也保持高能"&gt;重啟後也保持高能&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="方案-a最穩妥推薦"&gt;方案 A：最穩妥推薦&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-8809a2d8ce75afaaf86b81241d89bd5d-1"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;apt install cpufrequtils -y
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;GOVERNOR=&amp;#34;performance&amp;#34;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;gt;/etc/default/cpufrequtils
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;systemctl &lt;span class="nb"&gt;enable&lt;/span&gt; cpufrequtils
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;systemctl start cpufrequtils
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"apt install cpufrequtils -y\n\necho 'GOVERNOR=\"performance\"' \u003e/etc/default/cpufrequtils\nsystemctl enable cpufrequtils\nsystemctl start cpufrequtils\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="方案-bsystemd-自訂服務"&gt;方案 B：systemd 自訂服務&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-8809a2d8ce75afaaf86b81241d89bd5d-2"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# /etc/systemd/system/cpu-performance.service&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;Unit&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;Set CPU governor to performance
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;After&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;multi-user.target
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;Service&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;Type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;oneshot
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;ExecStart&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/bin/bash -c &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;for cpu in /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu[0-9]*; do echo performance &amp;gt; $cpu/cpufreq/scaling_governor; done&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;Install&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;WantedBy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;multi-user.target
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# /etc/systemd/system/cpu-performance.service\n[Unit]\nDescription=Set CPU governor to performance\nAfter=multi-user.target\n\n[Service]\nType=oneshot\nExecStart=/bin/bash -c 'for cpu in /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu[0-9]*; do echo performance \u003e $cpu/cpufreq/scaling_governor; done'\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=multi-user.target\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-8809a2d8ce75afaaf86b81241d89bd5d-3"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;systemctl daemon-reexec
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;systemctl daemon-reload
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;systemctl &lt;span class="nb"&gt;enable&lt;/span&gt; --now cpu-performance.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"systemctl daemon-reexec\nsystemctl daemon-reload\nsystemctl enable --now cpu-performance.service\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>